<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Princess Royal Court</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&family=Open+Sans&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffd6f6, #fff0f6);
      color: #5e005e;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 1rem;
      background: #ffe0f0;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: #cc0099;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    header img {
      width: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    nav {
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #ffccf2;
      padding: 1rem;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #880066;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    section {
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
      color: #c10086;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .gallery img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 3px solid #ffc2e8;
    }
    form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    input, textarea, button {
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 2px solid #ff99cc;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    button {
      background-color: #ff66b2;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover {
      background-color: #e0559d;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #ffe6f7;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Princess_crown_icon.svg/512px-Princess_crown_icon.svg.png" alt="Princess Crown">
    <h1>Princess Royal Court</h1>
    <p>Where every girl shines like royalty</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#events">Events</a>
    <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
    <a href="#apply">Join</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About the Court</h2>
    <p>Welcome to the Princess Royal Court, a magical place where young girls can embrace leadership, grace, and kindness. Our mission is to inspire royalty in heart, mind, and spirit.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="events">
    <h2>Upcoming Events</h2>
    <p>✨ Royal Tea Party — July 15th<br>🌸 Garden Gala — August 10th<br>👑 Princess Parade — September 2nd</p>
  </section>

  <section id="gallery">
    <h2>Gallery</h2>
    <div class="gallery">
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/200/200" alt="Princess moment 1" />
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/201/200" alt="Princess moment 2" />
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/202/200" alt="Princess moment 3" />
      <img src="https://placekitten.com/203/200" alt="Princess moment 4" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="apply">
    <h2>Apply to Join</h2>
    <form>
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Full Name" required />
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" required />
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Why do you want to join?" rows="4" required></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Submit Application</button>
    </form>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 Princess Royal Court. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
